{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06084","headline":"济州过赵叟家宴 · 王维","name":"济州过赵叟家宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虽与人境接，闭门成隐居。\n道言庄叟事，儒行鲁人余。\n深巷斜晖静，闲门高柳疎。\n荷锄修药圃，散帙曝农书。\n上客摇芳翰，中厨馈野蔬。\n夫君第高饮，景晏出林闾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06084.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06084","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}